# Trivy false positive on compiled ARM templates.
#
# AZU-0013 reports that the Key Vault network ACL does not block access by
# default. The Bicep template sets defaultAction=Deny, bypass=None and
# publicNetworkAccess=Disabled, and exposes the vault only through a Private
# Endpoint. Trivy's ARM parser does not evaluate the nested networkAcls block
# correctly for this template, so the finding is suppressed with this
# justification. Revisit when the template is deployed and validated.
AZU-0013
